### 2. Virtual Items, In-App Purchases & Subscriptions

**WaterSort: Color Puzzle** includes optional In-App Purchases (IAP) such as **"Remove Ads,"** virtual currency/coins, extra tubes, hints, or recurring VIP subscriptions, processed securely through **Google Play Billing** and **RevenueCat**.

* **Virtual Goods License:** Virtual items, coins, boosters, and "No Ads" entitlements have no real-world monetary value and cannot be exchanged for real cash, transferred, or sold outside the Game.
* **Billing & Auto-Renewal:** All purchases are billed through your Google Play account. If you purchase an auto-renewing subscription, it will automatically renew unless canceled at least **24 hours before the end of the current billing period**.
* **Managing Subscriptions:** You can manage or cancel subscriptions anytime in your **Google Play Store Account Settings > Payments & subscriptions > Subscriptions**. Uninstalling the Game does not cancel an active subscription.
* **Refunds:** All payments are processed by Google Play. Any refund requests are governed by Google Play’s official refund policy and must be requested directly through Google Play Support.

